---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="Data Processing Agreement - Varaha">
  <nav class="border-b border-white/10 glass backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex h-16 items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-8">
          <a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 relative">
            <img src="/mandala2.svg" alt="Varaha Logo" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain scale-110 opacity-40 animate-spin animate-duration-1000" style="filter: brightness(0) invert(1) sepia(1) saturate(2) hue-rotate(15deg) brightness(1.2);" />
            <span class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white tracking-widest transform -translate-x-5">varaha<span class="text-brand-purple">.ai</span></span>
          </a>
          <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-6">
            <a href="/docs" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Docs</a>
            <a href="/pricing" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Pricing</a>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Data Processing Agreement</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-300">GDPR Compliant • Last updated: April 5, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-8 space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">1. Parties and Definitions</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>1.1 Parties:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Data Controller:</strong> Varaha AI ("we", "us", "our")</li>
              <li><strong>Data Subject:</strong> You, the user of our services</li>
              <li><strong>Data Processor:</strong> Varaha AI acting as processor on behalf of clients</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>1.2 Definitions:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Personal Data:</strong> Any information relating to an identified or identifiable natural person</li>
              <li><strong>Processing:</strong> Any operation performed on personal data</li>
              <li><strong>Special Categories:</strong> Data revealing racial/ethnic origin, political opinions, religious beliefs, health data</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">2. Scope of Processing</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>2.1 Data Categories Processed:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Account identifiers (email, username)</li>
              <li>Contact information (name, address if provided)</li>
              <li>Usage data (API requests, timestamps)</li>
              <li>Technical data (IP address, device information)</li>
              <li>AI processing data (inputs, outputs, metadata)</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>2.2 Processing Purposes:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Service delivery and AI model execution</li>
              <li>Account management and authentication</li>
              <li>Billing and subscription management</li>
              <li>Service improvement and optimization</li>
              <li>Security and fraud prevention</li>
              <li>Legal compliance and reporting</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>2.3 Legal Basis:</strong> Processing is based on:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Contractual Necessity:</strong> Performance of service contract</li>
              <li><strong>Legitimate Interest:</strong> Service improvement, security, and fraud prevention</li>
              <li><strong>Consent:</strong> Where required for special category data</li>
              <li><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong> Compliance with applicable laws</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">3. Data Subject Rights</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>3.1 Right to Information:</strong> You have the right to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Know what personal data we process</li>
              <li>Understand the purposes of processing</li>
              <li>Know the categories of data processed</li>
              <li>Know who receives your data</li>
              <li>Know how long we retain data</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>3.2 Right to Access:</strong> You can request:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>A copy of your personal data</li>
              <li>Information about processing activities</li>
              <li>Details of data recipients</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>3.3 Right to Rectification:</strong> You can request:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Correction of inaccurate personal data</li>
              <li>Completion of incomplete personal data</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>3.4 Right to Erasure:</strong> You can request deletion when:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Data is no longer necessary for processing purposes</li>
              <li>You withdraw consent (where consent is the legal basis)</li>
              <li>You object to processing and there are no overriding legitimate grounds</li>
              <li>Data has been unlawfully processed</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>3.5 Right to Portability:</strong> You can request:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Your data in a structured, machine-readable format</li>
              <li>Direct transmission to another controller</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>3.6 Right to Object:</strong> You can object to processing based on:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Legitimate interests (except where we can demonstrate compelling legitimate grounds)</li>
              <li>Direct marketing (always)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">4. Security Measures</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>4.1 Technical Security:</strong> We implement:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Encryption of personal data (at rest and in transit)</li>
              <li>Pseudonymization where appropriate</li>
              <li>Access controls and authentication systems</li>
              <li>Regular security testing and vulnerability assessments</li>
              <li>Secure development lifecycle</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>4.2 Organizational Security:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Staff training on data protection</li>
              <li>Access limited to personnel with need-to-know</li>
              <li>Confidentiality agreements with all staff</li>
              <li>Regular security policy reviews</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>4.3 Incident Response:</strong> In case of personal data breach:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Notify supervisory authority within 72 hours</li>
              <li>Notify affected individuals without undue delay</li>
              <li>Document and investigate all breaches</li>
              <li>Implement remediation measures</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">5. Data Processing Obligations</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>5.1 Processing Instructions:</strong> We will:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Only process data on documented instructions from the controller</li>
              <li>Ensure personnel are bound by confidentiality obligations</li>
              <li>Implement appropriate technical and organizational measures</li>
              <li>Maintain records of processing activities</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>5.2 Subprocessor Management:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Obtain prior written authorization from controller</li>
              <li>Use subprocessors that provide sufficient data protection guarantees</li>
              <li>Ensure subprocessors comply with GDPR requirements</li>
              <li>Remain liable for subprocessor actions</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>5.3 International Transfers:</strong> For data transfers outside EEA:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Only to countries with adequate data protection</li>
              <li>With appropriate safeguards (standard contractual clauses)</li>
              <li>With controller consent and information</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">6. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>6.1 Retention Periods:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Account data: Retained while account is active</li>
              <li>Usage data: Retained for 12 months</li>
              <li>Support requests: Retained for 2 years</li>
              <li>Billing data: Retained for 7 years (tax requirements)</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>6.2 Deletion Triggers:</strong> Data will be deleted when:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Account is deleted by user</li>
              <li>Retention period expires</li>
              <li>Legal obligation requires deletion</li>
              <li>Processing purpose is no longer necessary</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>6.3 Deletion Methods:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Secure deletion preventing reconstruction</li>
              <li>Verification of deletion upon request</li>
              <li>Documentation of deletion process</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">7. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>7.1 Cookie Categories:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Essential:</strong> Required for service functionality</li>
              <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Analytics and optimization</li>
              <li><strong>Functional:</strong> Preferences and customization</li>
              <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> Personalized content and advertising</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>7.2 Consent Management:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Granular consent for non-essential cookies</li>
              <li>Easy withdrawal of consent</li>
              <li>Clear information about cookie purposes</li>
              <li>Privacy settings dashboard</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">8. International Data Transfers</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>8.1 Transfer Mechanisms:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) for EEA transfers</li>
              <li>Binding Corporate Rules for intra-organizational transfers</li>
              <li>Adequacy decisions for approved countries</li>
              <li>Derogations for specific situations</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>8.2 Transfer Safeguards:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Encryption of transferred data</li>
              <li>Access controls and authentication</li>
              <li>Regular security assessments</li>
              <li>Data minimization in transfers</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">9. Supervisory Authority Cooperation</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>9.1 DPO Appointment:</strong> We have appointed a Data Protection Officer:</p>
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <p>Email: dpo@varaha.ai</p>
              <p>Response Time: Within 30 days</p>
              <p>Language: English</p>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>9.2 Authority Cooperation:</strong> We will:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Cooperate with supervisory authorities</li>
              <li>Respond to inquiries within legal timeframes</li>
              <li>Provide access to facilities and documentation</li>
              <li>Implement authority recommendations</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>9.3 Breach Notification:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Notify without undue delay (within 72 hours)</li>
              <li>Provide breach details and impact assessment</li>
              <li>Outline remediation measures taken</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">10. Liability and Indemnification</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>10.1 Processor Liability:</strong> We are liable for:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Damages caused by non-compliance with GDPR</li>
              <li>Breaches of processing obligations</li>
              <li>Unauthorized processing activities</li>
              <li>Failure to implement appropriate security measures</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>10.2 Limitation of Liability:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Not liable for force majeure events</li>
              <li>Liability limited to actual damages</li>
              <li>No liability for indirect or consequential damages</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>10.3 Insurance Coverage:</strong> We maintain:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Cyber liability insurance</li>
              <li>Professional indemnity insurance</li>
              <li>Coverage for data breach incidents</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">11. Agreement Term and Amendments</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>11.1 Term:</strong> This agreement remains in effect until:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Terminated by either party with 30 days notice</li>
              <li>Superseded by a new agreement</li>
              <li>Required by changes in applicable law</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>11.2 Amendments:</strong> Changes require:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Written agreement between parties</li>
              <li>Compliance with GDPR requirements</li>
              <li>Notification to affected data subjects</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>11.3 Governing Law:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>EU GDPR for processing of EU residents' data</li>
              <li>Local data protection laws for other jurisdictions</li>
              <li>International data transfer frameworks</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">12. Contact and Dispute Resolution</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>12.1 Privacy Contacts:</strong></p>
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <p><strong>Data Protection Officer:</strong> dpo@varaha.ai</p>
              <p><strong>General Privacy:</strong> privacy@varaha.ai</p>
              <p><strong>Support:</strong> support@varaha.ai</p>
              <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 30 days for GDPR requests</p>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>12.2 Dispute Resolution:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Direct negotiation between parties</li>
              <li>Mediation services available upon request</li>
              <li>Supervisory authority complaints</li>
              <li>Local court jurisdiction for final resolution</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>12.3 Documentation:</strong> All processing activities are documented and available upon request.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 text-center">
        <a href="/terms" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors mr-6">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors mr-6">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/refund-policy" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors">Refund Policy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
